      "text": "Oh HELL YES!\n\n\nDiscussingFilm (@DiscussingFilm)\n\nThe \u2018Weapons\u2019 prequel \u2018GLADYS\u2019 is moving forward.\n\n Zach Shields (\u2018Godzilla vs Kong\u2019) is writing the script with Zach Cregger.\n\n(Source: Deadline)\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/DiscussingFilm/status/2039429607569367342#m",
