      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We're live on YouTube right now! Join us live! piped.video/live/9fDMXiOoAAg\n\n\n\nMeghan McCain (@MeghanMcCain)\n\nWe already had DC gossip columnist @juliegraceb booked for the show tomorrow but hoo boy do @mirandali and I have a lot to talk to her about on Citizen McCain tomorrow\u2026! \ud83d\udc40 \ud83e\uded6\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/MeghanMcCain/status/2039103914503458861#m",
